<title>USA: USDA reports soyoil sold to China in Feb 13 week.</title>
<headline>USDA reports soyoil sold to China in Feb 13 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said net soybean oil sales to China in the week ended Feb 13 totaled 23,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>In its weekly export sales report, USDA said the China activity included 2,000 tonnes in new sales and 21,000 tonnes in destination changes.</p>
